translate zh strings:

    old "A millenium, maybe more."
    new "千年，或许更久。"

    old "A person's connection to magic is tied to the world itself."
    new "人与魔法的连结，系于世界本身。"

    old "A great loud roaring voice summoned them from their work."
    new "一个巨大的轰鸣声召唤着他们离开工作。"

    old "A blistering hearth in the other end of the room."
    new "房间另一端，炽热的壁炉。"

    old "Obey him"
    new "服从他"

    old "A lot of things that had been unthinkable once, had now become normal. All in order to survive."
    new "许多曾经不可思议的事，如今都成了常态。一切为了生存。"
